# Larger Wooden Backlit Shop Sign

Status: DONE
Milestone: M20 Centered storefront identity
Dependencies: 23_FULL_WIDTH_AWNING_AND_PLAIN_HERO.todo; 24_LARGER_EDGE_BOOK_TABS.todo

## Purpose

The owner wants the logo and shop name larger and repositioned like a shop sign,
with a wooden backdrop and warm backlighting. Keep the existing font and logo;
move the existing navigation underneath, above the full-width awning.

## Tasks

- [x] Preserve original header/template, tests, public overview and showcase bytes.
- [x] Center a larger signboard using original Courgette and unchanged mark.
- [x] Add original subtle wood detailing and steady warm lettering/medallion glow.
- [x] Place the existing navigation below the name, preserving labels and targets.
- [x] Check320-2560px,200%text, contrast, keyboard, no-JS and forced-colour fallbacks.
- [x] Update the first README showcase image; keep exactly six linked images.
- [x] Run existing site/entrance checks, record the baseline entry-focus failure, and publish only the scoped public output.

## Acceptance criteria

- Logo/name are materially larger, centered and visually separated from navigation.
- Courgette font, actual mark bytes, business name and descriptor remain unchanged.
- Dark wood is header-only; cream body, green sections and pink notebooks remain.
- Text stays sharp/readable despite glow; no flashing or extra motion.
- No clipping at narrow widths or200%text; controls retain48pxtargets.
- Full-width awning and padded entrance remain unchanged.
- No new image-tool views or owner visual acceptance claimed.

